      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "questName": "Hidden Redirects",
      "questDescription": "<b>Maya:</b> Readers report that requests to my site are being redirected to a look-alike login page. Inspect the HTTP response, identify its stated destination, and separate that observation from claims about who caused it.",
      "questCompleteText": "<b>Maya:</b> The response returned status 302 and sent the request to expose-login.freepress-check.com. That destination is a lead, not attribution; we need the site's configuration and server logs to determine why the redirect occurred.",
